{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y部分屏幕的感受短语过于密集，纵向交替排列也不如X左右分区直观，快速扫读时容易失去落点。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的左右分区让观众更容易快速区分人物叙事和音乐感受，阅读路径也更稳定。但Y用放大加亮的关键词迅速交代每段的核心心理变化，而且把感受放到具体音乐时刻出现，让人更容易感受到情绪如何一步步发生、转变和回落。尤其是从舍不得旧日亲近、反复权衡，到接受想念却不再委屈自己，Y对人物动机、前后呼应和音乐情绪细节的呈现更充分、更具体。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "827aee2e-60d1-4fd9-bb2b-8f2590ba2631", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T002044412121Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.187, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:21:21.612857+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "461ef6ace80cb7a545da04fdf44355aa4f411eefa130bc3c474c02c5cfc2667b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2388